{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":37,"alongside":41,"kin":46,"engines":71,"usedOn":72,"sites":73,"crewed":74,"museums":75,"hero":76},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":31,"specs":32,"tagline":35,"description":36},"solar-orbiter","Solar Orbiter","orbiter","ESA / NASA","Europe / USA","Airbus Defence and Space","2020-02-10","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","首次详细太阳极区成像","Added with /fly mission JSON (#341 batch 4 — Sun-skirter pair). ESA-led with NASA launch + two instruments (SoloHI and the Heavy Ion Sensor).",[16,20,24,28],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Solar Orbiter — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solar_Orbiter","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Solar Orbiter — ESA","https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Solar_Orbiter","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Solar Orbiter — NASA","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/solar-orbiter/","deep",{"l":29,"u":30,"t":27},"Solar Orbiter factsheet — ESA (body 2.5 x 3.1 x 2.7 m)","https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Solar_Orbiter/Solar_Orbiter_factsheet",[3],{"length_m":33,"width_m":34,"diameter_m":34},3.1,2.5,"首次详细成像太阳极区","ESA主导的Solar Orbiter是首个专为近距离详细成像太阳极区而设计的航天器——在十年间利用金星引力辅助反复飞掠，逐步脱离黄道面，向约33°日面纬度倾角爬升。搭载十台仪器，结合遥感设备（PHI磁像仪、EUI极紫外成像仪、SPICE光谱仪、STIX X射线成像仪、METIS日冕仪、SoloHI日球层成像仪）与就位测量设备（磁力计、高能粒子探测器、太阳风等离子体探测器、射电+等离子体波探测器）。2020-02-10由NASA Atlas V 411从卡纳维拉尔角发射。2020-06-15首次近日点距离0.51 AU。工作近日点0.28 AU（约62 R☉），位于水星近日点距离以内。",[38],{"id":3,"name":4,"first":39,"year":40},"首个专门设计用于详细成像太阳极区的任务；通过高纬度遥感观测补充 Parker Solar Probe 的日冕内测量",2020,[42],{"id":43,"name":44,"tagline":45},"atlas-v","Atlas V","United Launch Alliance的改进型Atlas",[47,51,55,59,63,67],{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"ulysses","Ulysses","首颗在黄道面之上和之下观测太阳两极的航天器——1992 年木星引力辅助",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"hope","Hope (EMM)","首个阿拉伯星际任务",{"id":56,"name":57,"